@startuml wave004_ota_recovery_sequence
title Sequence D — OTA stage, boot, userspace recovery
participant Coordinator
participant ABUpdateManager
participant UserspaceRecovery

Coordinator -> ABUpdateManager : stage_update(signed metadata)
ABUpdateManager --> Coordinator : staged slot
Coordinator -> ABUpdateManager : commit_boot(slot)
ABUpdateManager --> Coordinator : active slot switched
Coordinator -> UserspaceRecovery : inspect()
UserspaceRecovery --> Coordinator : slot health
alt corrupt active slot
  Coordinator -> UserspaceRecovery : select_boot_slot(require_verified)
  UserspaceRecovery --> Coordinator : verified fallback
end

@enduml
